#: ../../index.md:9
msgid ""
"sapic 是一个自建图床：后端是 API-only 的 Flask 应用（`server/`，包名 `sapic`）， 前端是独立的 Vue 3 +"
" Vite 应用（`web/`），元数据存关系库（Peewee + PostgreSQL / MySQL / SQLite），不需要 Redis。"
msgstr ""
"sapic is a self-hosted image host: the backend is an API-only Flask "
"application (`server/`, package name `sapic`) and the front end is a "
"separate Vue 3 + Vite application (`web/`). Metadata lives in a relational "
"database (Peewee + PostgreSQL / MySQL / SQLite); Redis is not required."

#: ../../index.md:12
msgid ""
"**存储后端和登录方式都是扩展点**：一个第三方 pip 包声明 `__catalog__` 并实现约定的函数， 就能作为存储驱动或登录 "
"Provider 接入，核心代码不需要改动。这部分契约见 [扩展开发](extend/index.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**Storage backends and login methods are both extension points**: a third-"
"party pip package that declares `__catalog__` and implements the agreed "
"functions becomes a storage driver or login provider, without touching the "
"core. The contract is in [Extension development](extend/index.md)."

