#: ../../index.md:29
msgid ""
"当前版本 **2.0.0-pre.1**（v2 重写版）。相对 v1 的变化：后端改为 API-only + Peewee、前端独立为 Vue 3 "
"应用、运行时不再依赖 Redis；v1 代码不再随仓库发布（历史版本看 git tag）。 逐项变化见 `CHANGELOG.md`。"
msgstr ""
"Current version **2.0.0-pre.1** (the v2 rewrite). Compared with v1: the "
"backend is API-only + Peewee, the front end is a standalone Vue 3 app and "
"Redis is no longer required at runtime; the v1 sources are no longer "
"shipped in this repository (see the git tags). Item-by-item changes are in "
"`CHANGELOG.md`."

